      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The formatting style to be used for binary blobs. The default format is base64. The base64 format expects binary blobs to be provided as a base64 encoded string. The raw-in-base64-out format preserves compatibility with AWS CLI V1 behavior and binary values must be passed literally. When providing contents from a file that map to a binary blob [[p0]] will always be treated as binary and use the file contents directly regardless of the [[p1]] setting. When using [[p2]] the file contents will need to properly formatted for the configured [[p3]].",
